      "message": "refactor(ui): the multi-axis pages draw through the form seam\n\nThe multi-axis deburr page's \"Always on\" value of the shank and holder\nguard row uses list_row. The raw-call guard gets a multi-axis family\n(multiaxis_page, rotary_page, multiaxis_deburr_page) at zero.\n\nStacked on the turning slice (#4218): both change the guard rows.\n\nPinned by pages_do_not_add_raw_egui_calls_outside_the_form_seam,\nform_seam_guard_covers_only_the_migrated_families and\nthe_passes_tab_shows_the_shank_guard_as_always_on_with_no_switch.\n\nRefs #1122\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
